mira-agent — third-party notices
================================

This crate is a Rust translation of parts of the Pi agent package
(`@earendil-works/pi-agent-core`, `packages/agent`) and of the tool-argument
validation entry point in the Pi AI package, from the Pi repository, reference
commit `a276dabe5`. The translated design and algorithms come from:

- `packages/agent/src/types.ts`
- `packages/agent/src/agent.ts`
- `packages/agent/src/agent-loop.ts`
- `packages/agent/test/agent-loop.test.ts` (selected offline cases)
- `packages/ai/src/utils/validation.ts` (tool argument validation)

The crate is not a line-by-line port: it keeps the important invariants and
replaces the JavaScript mechanics with Rust ownership, bounded event delivery,
injected providers, explicit cancellation and explicit error categories. The
intentional differences, including everything that is deliberately not
translated, are listed in README.md. No durable state is provided.

